      "id": "claim_0419dc8389494312bf1b7e0a297ee149",
      "statement": "The reap-investigations Lambda has its own CloudWatch log group `/aws/lambda/<project>-<stage>-reap-investigations` governed by `log_retention_days`, and logs scheduled staleness-check reasoning (running-task counts, grace-period age using GRACE_PERIOD_HOURS), per-investigation EFS directory and access-point deletions, task-definition deregistration counts, and a final checked/reaped/skipped/error summary; its S3-related error logging deliberately omits file paths and object keys, logging only error codes and cluster/investigation IDs.",
